    <h3 itemprop="headline">Nanny says Lindsay Clancy appeared to be a loving mother before killing her 3 children</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Months before Lindsay Clancy strangled her three children, the family's former nanny said she saw her deal with significant weight loss, insomnia, and postpregnancy mental health issues.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/us/2026/08/05/nanny-says-lindsay-clancy-appeared-to-be-a-loving-mother-before-killing-her-3-children/"  >(Michael Casey, Associated Press, KPRC 2)</a>
