    <h3 itemprop="headline">A trip down shareware lane</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      I hope you’ll indulge me this week as I take a break from my usual rantings about agentic coding and meander down memory lane.
I learned to code BASIC in the mid-1970s at my progressive junior high school. In math class.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/08/05/a-trip-down-shareware-lane/"  >(Info World)</a>
    </p>
