    <h3 itemprop="headline">Data center developer eyes disused newpaper printing plant</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      As newspapers move online, the buildings that once housed their printing presses need new occupants.
The Minnesota Star Tribune has just sold its old printing plant on the edge of Minneapolis to the aptly named property developer Legacy Investing, which plans to create a new data center there.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/tech/2026/07/31/data-center-developer-eyes-disused-newpaper-printing-plant/"  >(Network World)</a>
    </p>
