      <img src="/static15/politics/2026/08/05/senate-confirms-new-cdc-director-diarrhea-causing-parasite-outbreak-sweeps-us.webp" alt="Senate confirms new CDC director as diarrhea-causing parasite outbreak sweeps US" itemprop="image" width="400" height="225"
        onerror="this.parentNode.style.display='none'" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" loading="lazy">
    </div>
    <h3 itemprop="headline">Senate confirms new CDC director as diarrhea-causing parasite outbreak sweeps US</h3>
    <p itemprop="text">
      Dr. Erica Schwartz was confirmed as CDC director along party lines amid concerns over whether she would stand up to Robert F. Kennedy Jr. on vaccines.
      <a itemprop="url" href="/politics/2026/08/05/senate-confirms-new-cdc-director-diarrhea-causing-parasite-outbreak-sweeps-us/"  >(Fox News)</a>
    </p>
  </div>
